'''Gudegude à la mode''' (ぐでぐでアラモード) is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Gudetama Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 6.2 Update|Version 6.2]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Gudegude à la mode
|image = E 352.png
|appearance = [[Gudetama Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 450円 - 1,777円
}}

==Enemy==
Another weak enemy, it has 5x more health than [[Gudetama Plate (Enemy)|Gudetama Plate]], but its attack power and range do not make it a problem, although it has a 50% chance to [[Knockback|knockback]] cats.

==Strategy==
This enemy is not significantly stronger than [[Gudetama Plate (Enemy)|Gudetama Plate]]. Meatshields such as [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cat]] or [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]] along with a ranged attackers like [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]] or [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] should be able to dispatch this enemy fairly quickly.

